      "text": "Breaking ice to keep America moving.\n\nWinter weather doesn’t stop commerce, or the U.S. Coast Guard. \n\nIn 2025, @USCG facilitated the movement of $5.4T in maritime commerce and 1.8B tons of cargo across U.S. waterways. From the Northeast to the Great Lakes, our icebreaking crews ensure critical supplies reach communities, even in the harshest winter conditions. With historic funding from the One Big Beautiful Bill Act, the Coast Guard is recapitalizing our domestic icebreaker fleet and maximizing our return on investment across America’s waterways. \n\n#USCG #Icebreaking #MTS #Commerce @DHSgov @USCGNortheast @USCGGreatLakes @USCGLANTAREA",
